    <string name="privacy_offline_title">Your data stays on this phone</string>
    <string name="privacy_offline_text">Hayat has no internet permission, no account, no ads and no analytics. Nothing leaves your device unless you export a backup yourself. Android cloud backup is turned off for Hayat, so uninstalling the app or losing the phone deletes your data unless you have exported a backup file.</string>
