    <string name="about_help">Help</string>
    <string name="about_help_text">Use the Add button to create tasks, reminders, routines and logs. Open any feature from Home → All features. Reminders depend on Android settings — see Settings → Reminders &amp; notifications if a reminder does not appear.</string>
    <string name="about_medical">Medicine, water, diet, sleep and fitness features are reminder and logging tools. They are not medical advice and do not check doses or drug interactions.</string>
    <string name="about_religious">Prayer times are calculated on the device and may differ from your local mosque. Hijri dates are calculated and may differ from local moon sighting.</string>
